## Enable xCAT Repository

Enable the xCAT package repositories. xCAT ships an `xCAT-release` package that
configures the `xcat-core` (main xCAT packages) and `xcat-dep` (OS/arch
dependencies) repositories and installs the package-signing key -- the same
pattern as the `ohpc-release` package used earlier:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
<!-- ohpc_comment Enable xCAT repositories via the xCAT-release package -->
```bash
dnf -y install \
  {{ xcat_repo_base }}/{{ xcat_release }}/xcat-core/xCAT-release-latest.noarch.rpm
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->
